61cc37bb29625d6885c8f7359787d"},"STX.q.riskrwwas.0":{"c":"STX","kind":"risk-was","quote":"We have been, and may in the future be, adversely affected by reduced, delayed, loss of or canceled purchases by, one or more of our key customers, including large hyperscale data center companies and CSPs.","source":"STX-0001137789-25-000157","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-01","proof":"20dfbb12eeb2c6006191f1f9e6e760eec972b27118fb0eb8d4aca9d194a4a52f"},"STX.q.riskrw.1":{"c":"STX","kind":"risk","quote":"The deterioration of demand for disk drives in these consumer and client-centric markets has accelerated, and we believe this deterioration may continue and may further accelerate, which has caused and could further cause our operating results to suffer.","source":"STX-0001137789-26-000159","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-04","proof":"8126874b4a2edc002eec42bce42195a16959e7e5161bfd4a86a5aa2cc4419320"},"STX.q.riskrwwas.1":{"c":"STX","kind":"risk-was","quote":"The deterioration of demand for disk drives in certain of the legacy markets has accelerated, and we believe this deterioration may continue and may further accelerate, which has caused and could further cause our operating results to suffer.","source":"STX-0001137789-25-000157","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-01","proof":"0f3a0d79a636fa79dceb4c02bd7485d125270117d48753a8ff38d208cc70ee68"},"STX.q.riskrw.2":{"c":"STX","kind":"risk","quote":"Changes in demand for computer systems, data storage subsystems and consumer electronic devices have previously caused, and may in the future cause, a decline in demand for our products.","source":"STX-0001137789-26-000159","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-04","proof":"0c95346c7f6f6cb80b739fabb1e26d3a9c7127eaf9978d6e0b685bd240725df1"},"STX.q.riskrwwas.2":{"c":"STX","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Changes in demand for computer systems, data storage subsystems and consumer electronic devices has previously caused, and may in the future cause, a decline in demand for our products.","source":"STX-0001137789-25-000157","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-01","proof":"fc576506996dbf5883b7b9c05801c013373d93f59eacb53b1ec6a4f780146f0e"},"STX.q.riskrw.3":{"c":"STX","kind":"risk","quote":"If we do not adequately control our costs or if any cost reduction activities that we undertake do not deliver the results we expect, we will not be able to compete effectively and our financial condition may be adversely impacted.","source":"STX-0001137789-26-000159","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-04","proof":"a7963807f6da8b4dd6ef7bcf6a2f0378bcba4e1f266b8ba5332004cdb39f1f75"},"STX.q.riskrwwas.3":{"c":"STX","kind":"risk-was","quote":"If we do not adequately control our costs or if any cost reduction initiatives that we undertake do not deliver the results we expect, we will not be able to compete effectively and our financial condition may be adversely impacted.","source":"STX-0001137789-25-000157","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-01","proof":"bcfdc22787fbc0916405b36d6b9ca6572e2afe994e197849f7a4ff533efb8960"},"STX.q.riskrw.4":{"c":"STX","kind":"risk","quote":"Shortages or delays in the receipt of, or cost increases in, critical components, equipment or raw materials necessary to manufacture our products, as well as reliance on single-source suppliers, have in the past and may in the future affect our production and development of products and harm our operating results.","source":"STX-0001137789-26-000159","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-04","proof":"ce3adb24e94b1d8bbd9121fb8cc2bf7760d12ea10504c9a75027a2ac2868f90b"},"STX.q.riskrwwas.4":{"c":"STX","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Shortages or delays in the receipt of, or cost increases in, critical components, equipment or raw materials necessary to manufacture our products, as well as reliance on single-source suppliers, has in the past and may in the future affect our production and development of products and harm our operating results.","source":"STX-0001137789-25-00015